# Reload app after code changes

When you change app or UI code the user needs to test (React Native / Expo screens, components, styles, navigation, etc.):

1. Apply the code change.
2. **Immediately reload** the running Expo app on the Android emulator (or device) without waiting to be asked.
3. Prefer a quick reload (`adb shell input text "RR"`, reopen the Expo URL, or equivalent) when Metro is already running; restart Expo only if needed.

Do not end a turn that includes testable UI changes without having triggered a reload.
